{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":14447,\"title\":\"L for Love\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"M jak miłość is a Polish soap opera, revolving around the multiple generations of the Mostowiak family. The series premiered on November 4, 2000 on TVP2, primarily as a weekly drama, and after one season shifting into a new timeslot and extending to two episodes per week. For the last few years the show has been the most watched drama on Polish television. Its popularity led to a Russian adaptation, entitled Lyubov kak Lyubov.\\n\\nThe series is also broadcast on the international channel TVP Polonia with English subtitles.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8agoxhXGlv6ICYa733bDrfKnJ3.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jZhbWvp8tNrCA1zTyQQGPh0kabG.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":13,\"year\":2000,\"genres\":[\"Soap\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":27,\"totalEpisodes\":1954,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"TVP2\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"PL\",\"name\":\"Poland\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-10-27\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":589507,\"name\":\"Ryszard Zatorski\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ynDdooY2vAnZbP9FwbDe8wqn6Qu.jpg\"},{\"id\":1522844,\"name\":\"Kinga Dębska\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mqj61rSizkQO83Q889j1Q45jPMj.jpg\"},{\"id\":592917,\"name\":\"Marek Bukowski\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eR15kwBWDKJrEOjZQ4D78AnpvEj.jpg\"},{\"id\":1245073,\"name\":\"Rafał Mroczek\",\"character\":\"Paweł Zduński\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yeKwBO7WDrYGNn0qEkFMCxrApbv.jpg\"},{\"id\":1138616,\"name\":\"Teresa Lipowska\",\"character\":\"Barbara Mostowiak\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaubXaMiAbMfiwR7NDZehOEHziR.jpg\"},{\"id\":553267,\"name\":\"Dominika Ostałowska\",\"character\":\"Marta Mostowia